   "source_tag": "_t",
   "args_order": null,
   "source": "Viral grooves allow your weapons to apply an infectious agent on contact, dealing immediate blight damage and reducing their highest stat.  While this strain is effective it lacks the ability to spread or adapt to its hosts weaknesses.  Perhaps there are better methods to be found.",
   "target": "病毒之槽可以让你的武器在接触时附带病毒，立即造成枯萎伤害并降低目标最高的一项属性。尽管这种病毒株行之有效，但它缺乏传播能力，也无法适应宿主的弱点。或许还有更好的方法……",
   "source_file": "/workspace/tome4-dlcs/orcs/tome-orcs/data/tinkers/therapeutics.lua (unpinned public DLC checkout)",
